{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>For you know our encampments in the wilderness.</b> That is, therefore I appease your face that you go with us, because you know our encampments and the miracles and mighty acts that the Holy One, blessed be He, performed with us, and you were eyes for us — those who see you with us will say: he did not abandon his land and his inheritance; were it not because he saw and knew the greatness of the Holy One, blessed be He, and the good things He did for His people."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:09:01.572597710Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}